From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 17:34:58 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Fix /lock <-> /activate redirect loop and the 5 failing CI
 tests

- server: exempt /lock from the license gate. Unlicensed + lock password
  bounced /lock -> /activate -> /lock forever (ERR_TOO_MANY_REDIRECTS).
  Also restrict the lock routes' `next` param to same-site paths.
- tests: regression tests for the loop and for open-redirect `next` values.
- tests: update stale assertions for the v3 dashboard / v9.8 sidebar.
- tests: re-pin dark-theme hashes for theme.css and job-theme.css
  (additive, deliberate changes; no dark tokens moved).
- tests: run the GA fitness-noise test at 1000 sims (noise ~5.5%)
  instead of 300 (~11% after the day_block_days=1 calibration).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013jaQdFPUgsomDm2zZZw6CR
